            "review_title": "Review at Daiichi Ramen & Curry",
            "review_text": "Leonhkny\nHong Kong, China29703 contributions\n0\nSerious?\nApr 2023 • Business\nWhile Ho Chi Minh City's Japantown is full of quality eateries, this is a clear exception. As its name hints, Daiichi Ramen & Curry serves quick Japanese meals. While price is modest, food is terrible. Tsukemen is nothing reminiscent of the authentic dipping noodle. The noodle itself is watery and sauce bland and tasteless. Fried chicken is overcooked. Do avoid at all cost.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 21, 2023",
